{"version":1,"content":"<p>中新網周一（2日）報道，內地有售賣衣物商家指出，現時許多顧客將新買衣物穿個夠後，按消費者權利在7日後退貨，「我們也不想客戶收到二手的衣服」，是以將吊牌弄成A4紙般大，並以大字標註「拆除不退不換」。</p><p>有網民稱這類吊牌嚴重干擾試穿。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:02.461537+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:06:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.957887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:30.878827+00:00","content_hash":"6e93f43b15366df8b69caca7ef81bcc9aa97e2767861167a124c329febe7b743","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}